  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR31.16 Table 1 row (D)",
      "summary": "Row (D) of MAR31.16 Table 1 ends at 0.95 ≤ δ < 1.00, so a delta of exactly 1.00 falls in no bucket.",
      "impact": "Position: Deep in-the-money option risk factor with delta point exactly 1.00 and 40 real prices. Reading a: No bucket exists, so no observation can be counted Reading b: Treated as the 0.95 to 1.00 bucket, end point read as included Difference: 40 countable observations versus 0",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
